@* PageLoading — spinner shown during a page's first async fetch, before it's known whether the
   resource exists. Blazor Server renders a component synchronously once, before an awaited
   OnParametersSetAsync/OnInitializedAsync completes; gating a page directly on "detail is null"
   (found during a 2026-07 UI audit on ReportPreview.razor) makes that first render show a "not
   found" EmptyState even for a report/job that loads fine a moment later.
   Usage: @if (_loading) { <PageLoading /> } else if (_detail is null) { <EmptyState ... /> } else { ... } *@

<div class="empty-state">
    <i class="ti ti-loader-2" style="font-size:28px;color:var(--fg-faint);animation:spin 0.9s linear infinite"></i>
    <div class="es-title">Loading…</div>
</div>
